  CardStory: "That makes sense, there is a hierarchy to it! Up and down it goes,
    and Spades2 is at the bottom.. I copy the lines, and read as much as I can understand.
    Recruits like Spades2 don\u2019t usually get access to this kind of text. It\u2019s
    a good learning opportunity for Spades2. For me. He shivers, sitting alone on
    the small desk he\u2019s been assigned while he works in the archives.\r\n\r\nSpades4,
    his missing bunkmate, has returned. Has he had a bunkmate before? Spades2 remembers
    him, but he knows he hasn\u2019t. Still, the young woman smiled when he made
    her way into the barracks this morning. Ear to ear.\r\n\r\nThe new\u2026 Or old,
    Spades2 supposes. The old bunkmate is different from what he remembers. Straight
    posture, white teeth. Polite and friendly. But she eats with her left hand. Wasn\u2019t
    she right-handed yesterday? Didn\u2019t he stand a bit shorter? Weren\u2019t
    her eyes different?"
